# Generated caches from the local checkout. Without this the build context
# carries whatever the developer last compiled into the image, and Laravel then
# serves it: a route cache built against older code unserializes into
# __PHP_Incomplete_Class objects, which surface as 500s far from the cause. The
# Dockerfile recreates this directory, and the entrypoint warms what it needs.
/bootstrap/cache/*
